[{"title":"书王景撝丽泽书室卷","author":"王恭","text":"东邻贩缯为贾衒，西邻握笔趋州县。\n北邻金多家富豪，笑我儒生事书卷。\n君家住近翠微峰，屋里芸香户外松。\n朝经暮史有馀暇，饮水曲肱无戚容。\n永日垂帷坐佔毕，复喜朋来同散帙。\n活水旁通丽泽回，真源直向灵台出。\n逐句寻章失本真，端居谁复贯天人。\n鸢飞鱼跃无穷趣，云淡风轻总是春。\n以兹学究幽玄理，浩气弥浸小天地。\n四壁犹堪薄万钟，一瓢自可轻千驷。\n开门合屿带壶山，一片清晖几席间。\n家僮洗砚沧浪近，稚子晒书篱落閒。\n阿翁今年七十五，鹤发飘然映章甫。\n绣衣骢马焕林泉，禅室香床度花雨。\n綵服翩翩日过庭，羡君容鬓未星星。\n常因益友开三径，不负传家教一经。\n自愧贫居破茅屋，土中白蚁何其毒。\n万卷床头一蠹休，明日从君借书读。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34619,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵送人落第归江南","author":"王恭","text":"凤台寒日莫，千里送君还。\n别梦愁京雨，乡心絓楚山。\n落花偏拥棹，归雁独临关。\n应醉家林月，青云好是閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34620,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野望","author":"王恭","text":"极浦遥山外，荒江瘴海头。\n夕岚松叶暗，孤屿鸟声幽。\n塞笛飘寒泪，邻讴起莫愁。\n连天秋草色，归思日悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34621,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑浮丘被诏重赴京师","author":"王恭","text":"关河残叶下，征棹复西游。\n远火台城迥，微霜禁苑秋。\n诏书天上出，宣室夜深留。\n浩荡论经史，时时近冕旒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34622,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘逸人还山","author":"王恭","text":"天高寒日莫，念念独还山。\n绿树悬心远，孤云入望閒。\n水流侵石榻，落叶拥柴关。\n别后分遥想，诸峰杳霭间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34623,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅江夜泊","author":"王恭","text":"卸帆依暝渚，带酒宿沙头。\n戍鼓严更漏，寒钟落钓舟。\n霜明城下水，月暗海西楼。\n薄晓啼猿罢，苍苍远树愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34624,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山人入城","author":"王恭","text":"行行别翠微，迢递入城扉。\n故旧多零落，人烟半是非。\n清霜寒使马，落日动军麾。\n薄莫遥钟起，还寻旧路归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34625,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题无诸庙壁","author":"王恭","text":"野庙大江干，萧萧树色寒。\n断碑荒草没，画壁古苔乾。\n龙去春潮在，?鸣海月残。\n英雄那可问，东逝更漫漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34626,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中闻子规","author":"王恭","text":"关路草凄凄，枫林杜宇啼。\n思深湘岸曲，声断郢云西。\n故国春归尽，他乡客去迷。\n凄凉听渐近，疲马亦长嘶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34627,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春莫田家","author":"王恭","text":"野藤垂谷口，林径少人行。\n茅屋先春补，沙田候水耕。\n篱深孤犬吠，树密一鸠鸣。\n花落家僮扫，寥寥远市声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34628,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江楼闻笛","author":"王恭","text":"纤月絓枫林，晴楼覆夕阴。\n谁家吹凤管，永夜作龙吟。\n杨柳边头恨，梅花客里新。\n天明汉江上，唯见水云深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34629,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古镜","author":"王恭","text":"匣里菱花镜，摩挲恨转深。\n土花浮绿晕，秋月闭寒阴。\n汉女曾窥貌，秦人己照心。\n蛟龙今剥落，徒尔折黄金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34630,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"翡翠","author":"王恭","text":"羡尔炎州翠，双栖羽翼微。\n雨香红玉觜，风飏碧罗衣。\n避鹘藏深竹，衔鱼上钓矶。\n吴宫矜首饰，莫道网罗稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34631,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人从海城军","author":"王恭","text":"从军江海上，征棹去微茫。\n瘴雨孤城白，秋风大野黄。\n旌旂连蟹舍，烟火近鲛房。\n但使封侯贵，何须忆故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34632,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人还岭海","author":"王恭","text":"别君沧海上，况是暮秋天。\n乱叶惊离席，孤云逐去船。\n荔枝瘴雨外，椰叶夕阳边。\n回首风尘隔，相思共渺然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34633,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松寺清秋","author":"王恭","text":"迢递青莲宇，云边事事幽。\n松花山路晚，鹤梦寺门秋。\n黄叶僧前落，清泉屋上流。\n所嗟尘累久，那得此淹留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34634,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日游山寺","author":"王恭","text":"荒山残日晚，秋思正凄凉。\n野鸟啼花径，溪泉溜竹房。\n钟声云外远，树色雨中黄。\n更与询休辈，焚香坐石床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34635,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送衲子游方","author":"王恭","text":"乞食向人烟，心閒处处禅。\n浮杯江上月，浣衲涧中泉。\n蜀道峨眉远，庐山瀑布悬。\n孤云自飞去，谁得扣玄玄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34636,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻刘一敦擢监察御史","author":"王恭","text":"几年游璧水，一旦候金扉。\n敕赐骑骢马，人看著锦衣。\n天连枫陛晓，霜借柏台威。\n此际如相忆，毋令尺素稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34637,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽邢逸民","author":"王恭","text":"流落衣冠没，他乡几度春。\n青山行卖卜，白首坐忘贫。\n昔爱林中酒，今为草下尘。\n平生数行泪，为尔独沾巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34638,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老将","author":"王恭","text":"发白未侯封，休论旧日功。\n酬恩空有剑，锡宴岂无弓。\n关塞孤愁外，风霜百战中。\n太平应弃掷，流落灞桥东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34639,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽僧","author":"王恭","text":"人间?久住，只履独西归。\n夜雨虚禅座，寒山葬衲衣。\n鸽栖青草塔，猿吊白云扉。\n从此无期会，空令泪欲挥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34640,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜到渔家","author":"王恭","text":"渡口集昏鸦，缘村径路赊。\n枫青迷野水，竹密暗江沙。\n远火人声绝，孤帆日影斜。\n扣门惊犬吠，如入子陵家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34641,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫人入道","author":"王恭","text":"雨露恩宁薄，烟霞思独迷。\n向人披鹤氅，无分卷龙衣。\n女伴愁将别，君王梦亦稀。\n他年青鸟使，衔表到金扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34642,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经漂母墓","author":"王恭","text":"寂寞淮阴路，荒城接楚原。\n谁能怀漂母，曾此饭王孙。\n孤冢今犹在，千金不复论。\n自惭非国士，兹去向何门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34643,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭君怨","author":"王恭","text":"掩泪向边州，君恩此日休。\n身随塞上远，心是汉宫愁。\n雁塞春难度，龙堆草易秋。\n玉容何足贵，翻作羽林羞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34644,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山路见落花","author":"王恭","text":"野花垂岭口，无主亦芳菲。\n色映林僧帽，香随木客衣。\n凄凉?折去，零落鸟衔归。\n日暮行人绝，山风吹更飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34645,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林山人入城","author":"王恭","text":"林栖无外事，访旧入东城。\n渐失闻猿处，多逢结驷行。\n古榕藏驿舍，残柳拂军营。\n薄暮遥钟起，纷纷薜荔情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34646,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王孙挟弹图","author":"王恭","text":"金衣骑小驷，迢递茂陵山。\n接鹘花边过，鸣鞭柳外还。\n断猿惊羽箭，过雁落金丸。\n归醉琼楼夕，天街雪正寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34647,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋暮寄山中人","author":"王恭","text":"水国催寒早，霜风几夜砧。\n怀君隐居处，落叶乱山深。\n野鸟无遗迹，孤云不系心。\n悬知灯火夕，闲坐听猿吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34648,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书江山别意图送羽人还神乐观","author":"王恭","text":"羽人何处去，归事玉宸君。\n飞佩花间别，横箫鹤上闻。\n过关闽树断，絓席楚江分。\n想到斋宫夕，圜丘候五云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34649,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同故人曾伯刚燕集陈家楼","author":"王恭","text":"偶作山阳会，翻惊梦里逢。\n盍簪怜草色，携手叹萍踪。\n雨暗楼中树，云閒鸟外峰。\n故人湖海气，应不愧元龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34650,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书谷口云深图","author":"王恭","text":"连峰转幽邃，竟夕白云多。\n峡里非人境，春深但女萝。\n仙源空翠远，香界断钟和。\n鸾鹤飘飘去，尘踪独奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34651,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题黄声玉环清楼","author":"王恭","text":"楼虚千瘴合，水木澹清华。\n积雨仙源白，归云鸟道斜。\n褰衣凌野翠，捲幔拂秋霞。\n想见横经夕，苍藤落数花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34652,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题郁判官望云思亲卷","author":"王恭","text":"吴岳片云横，偏关远宦情。\n乡林孤望断，客路寸心倾。\n带雁迷亲舍，缘霜度客旌。\n太行曾按节，千古重怀英。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34653,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈孟敷耕图","author":"王恭","text":"野情鱼鸟边，孤兴寄秋田。\n霜降黄花酒，山空白日眠。\n云根缃帙散，林杪桔槔悬。\n予亦栖栖者，遥知沮溺贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34654,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟唐储光羲题陆山人楼","author":"王恭","text":"爱尔幽栖处，楼居水木清。\n松高清鹤梦，竹密助猿吟。\n帘捲山光入，窗虚日色明。\n独惭官府系，临眺不胜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34655,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟唐祖咏江南旅情","author":"王恭","text":"支离那可道，摇落倍凄然。\n归梦将秋月，愁心对暮天。\n吴山苍霭断，楚树白云连。\n日夕凉风动，乡原若个边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34656,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟唐祖咏题韩少府水亭","author":"王恭","text":"少府爱清晖，孤亭近翠微。\n石林娱晚坐，池水净风扉。\n野鹿衔花过，溪云带鸟归。\n何须谢缨冕，临眺始忘机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34657,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟唐祖咏苏氏别业","author":"王恭","text":"忘机依别墅，丰水带南山。\n野竹连孤屿，溪云伴独閒。\n鹿鸣花外去，鹤梦雨中还。\n寂寂何人到，年年但掩关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34658,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟唐王仲初边上送故人","author":"王恭","text":"羌笛与铙歌，相逢奈别何。\n关河孤梦断，边地几人过。\n沙碛鸿声小，轮台雪片多。\n看君马上去，?取醉颜酡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34659,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜拥炉有怀","author":"王恭","text":"拥炉寒夜坐，寂寞对閒居。\n冻雪千山白，情人万里馀。\n京南无过雁，汶上少来书。\n愁绝残灯里，横窗片月虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34660,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人奉使市马","author":"王恭","text":"使节向宛西，承恩出御堤。\n千金求骏骨，万里得霜蹄。\n汉武思神骥，燕昭重駃騠。\n归朝应早计，苜蓿苑中齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34661,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧游金陵","author":"王恭","text":"金陵维帝里，宫阙五云间。\n师到是何日，禅西若个山。\n浣衣天界晓，清梵紫金閒。\n早晚门人念，东林定里还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34662,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上巳游五云寺","author":"王恭","text":"诗酒兰亭会，如何共远公。\n行看五云里，绝似虎溪中。\n清梵花台雨，名香竹径风。\n未须论祓禊，自觉万缘空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34663,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春送人还温陵","author":"王恭","text":"斗酒惜分襟，温陵驿路深。\n关河孤客棹，沧海故人心。\n荖叶迷行旆，桐花醉客簪。\n清源仙洞好，知尔日登临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34664,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征妇怨","author":"王恭","text":"夫婿远从征，云中路几深。\n作旗馀帐帛，买剑断钗金。\n被绣香兰浅，妆奁凤影沉。\n年年衣上泪，随恨寄寒砧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34665,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽黄蘖大休上人","author":"王恭","text":"只履复还西，令人忆我师。\n空门了生灭，尘世漫凄其。\n驯鸽栖新塔，灵花落故枝。\n愁来双树下，空有泪如丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34666,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之云雨","author":"王恭","text":"云中路不穷，迢递入乌蒙。\n马上看山别，天涯见月同。\n昆明波淡淡，金齿树朦朦。\n异域空相忆，音书几日通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34667,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人从温陵军","author":"王恭","text":"温陵南海上，孤剑独横行。\n策马经花县，看山到柳营。\n明珠来市舶，荖叶遍山城。\n长揖嫖姚幕，从容论五兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34668,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠倭僧","author":"王恭","text":"参方离日本，乞食向中州。\n沧海无行迹，浮天但法舟。\n扶桑孤岛曙，贝叶旧房秋。\n借问西来意，无言坐石头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34669,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人使重驿","author":"王恭","text":"奉诏浮东海，鱼龙护去舟。\n双星别鳷鹊，几日过琉球。\n绝岛夷王拜，重番使节游。\n归朝应早计，休起见京楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34670,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花戍观练兵","author":"王恭","text":"笳吹动江城，将军练五兵。\n水摇金甲影，风度角弓声。\n戎幕斜连海，军麾绕下营。\n时平严武备，非欲树功名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34671,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日游棋山寺","author":"王恭","text":"载酒空门下，林幽暑气清。\n半天闻梵语，双壁隐钟声。\n野鸟知禅意，孤云薄世荣。\n何应谢尘事，从此学无生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34672,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏夜泛江因造澹山","author":"王恭","text":"画舫宜凉夜，沧江酒气清。\n星河分棹影，鸥鹭起歌声。\n海旷天低水，潮平月到城。\n澹山有佳处，遥见蚌珠明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34673,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送中州逸人归龙塘","author":"王恭","text":"幽栖何处是，积水近柴扉。\n樽酒沙头别，輶轩月下归。\n竹深林鸟待，村远故人稀。\n遥想斋居里，狂吟竟落晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34674,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽林医敬仲殁爪蛙图","author":"王恭","text":"君怀秦缓术，埋骨向扶桑。\n昔卖人间药，今修地下方。\n魂飞随汉使，客葬感夷王。\n此日龙门道，清?益断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34675,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄衣曲","author":"王恭","text":"秋风飞虏尘，闺里捣衣频。\n拭泪逢边使，缄情寄远人。\n不辞劳妾手，未省称君身。\n莫待封侯日，归来但著新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34676,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题渔舍秋烟","author":"王恭","text":"茆宇邻鲛室，青山落钓舟。\n菊潭霜渐冷，枫树叶皆流。\n酒醒闻边雁，机閒见海鸥。\n烟波随处好，妻子亦无忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34677,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居春晓","author":"王恭","text":"仙源隔几尘，林馆更宜春。\n叶暗青连雨，云孤白近人。\n浣衣溪沫绿，濯足野苔新。\n余亦无机者，诛茅愿卜邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34678,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都门即事","author":"王恭","text":"都门閒望处，车马满香尘。\n禁绕龙池树，钟残凤阙春。\n衣冠三辅客，剑履五侯宾。\n唯有扬雄宅，门前草自新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34679,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉赋闽藩参政凤阳张公忠孝堂","author":"王恭","text":"淮右多卿族，天朝重缙绅。\n东胶呈彩凤，左辖应祥麟。\n荒服资文化，名藩寄大臣。\n一官忠孝在，三调渥恩均。\n恋阙瞻天迥，荣亲爱日频。\n怀英云独望，令伯表深陈。\n乡远龙飞处，堂高鹤发新。\n涂山青历历，濠水绿津津。\n衣彩趋庭梦，腰金报主身。\n甘棠何彩萃，风木忽悲辛。\n霜露思泉壤，云霄睇玉宸。\n心随葵藿尽，情感蓼莪真。\n堂搆仍先志，纲常激后人。\n所希登宰辅，特此赞皇仁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34680,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄三衢陈八董教","author":"王恭","text":"怀君属秋暮，离思满凉天。\n百越孤云外，三衢独雁边。\n?鸣飞楚叶，潮落见湖田。\n泮水横经绿，柯山卷幔连。\n醉吟官舍雨，兴扫墨池烟。\n旧业闲三径，移家恋一毡。\n风霜怜宦薄，雨露喜生全。\n交态今寥落，相思独惘然。\n逢秋惊发变，怅别使心悬。\n欲拜桐溪墓，因行雪夜船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34681,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书宋儒陈烈官诰后","author":"王恭","text":"吾爱陈夫子，名高庆历中。\n官卑心独古，迹遁道弥通。\n屡荐金门剡，难羁璧水铜。\n七闽沾化雨，百代仰儒风。\n芸阁丝纶在，芹宫祀享同。\n云孤怜故物，应复继高踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34682,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"欧阳明府弦歌亭","author":"王恭","text":"令尹文忠后，卢陵世代深。\n青年宜带印，白日但鸣琴。\n浩荡春阳泽，雍容太古音。\n一亭崇礼教，百里动讴吟。\n露冕朝氛净，褰帷午树阴。\n风云飘逸气，山水写冲襟。\n桃李清官舍，棠梨罥客簪。\n昔闻常衮化，今识子游心。\n高士恒分榻，贫人屡赐金。\n所希金石刻，千古作佳箴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34683,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美宪佥陈公重修玉融天宝陂","author":"王恭","text":"咨访代宸聪，霜威八郡中。\n褰帷询潦旱，按俗悯年凶。\n地古潴防失，江流斥卤通。\n绣衣亲计粟，玉节坐鸠工。\n瘴海秋腾隼，关河晓驻骢。\n已兼修废坠，非但慰疲癃。\n陂水寒仍绿，鹾田岁又丰。\n永贻饘粥惠，宁忘我侯功。\n利泽思王景，恩波感白公。\n铭心那可报，镌石纪无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34684,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书黄典幕磐石书室记","author":"王恭","text":"盘石邻幽构，青山独下帷。\n别来乡望断，心远宦情微。\n官舍羁黄绶，亲闱念綵衣。\n秪应悬魏阙，那得恋春晖。\n故国铜鱼杳，音书白雁稀。\n家林唯有梦，时绕薜萝归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34685,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]